1d:["$","section","our-pause-friendly-defaults",{"id":"our-pause-friendly-defaults","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Our pause-friendly defaults"}],[["$","p","OutBrick has no lives counter, no ad gate, and no requirement to protect a fragile run. A board can be left unfinished. Undo stays available. The daily brick can be missed without turning tomorrow into a punishment. These choices do not solve every problem a player may have, but they lower the amount of pressure the game itself adds.",{"children":"OutBrick has no lives counter, no ad gate, and no requirement to protect a fragile run. A board can be left unfinished. Undo stays available. The daily brick can be missed without turning tomorrow into a punishment. These choices do not solve every problem a player may have, but they lower the amount of pressure the game itself adds."}],["$","p","We also keep the game visually calm and the core session legible. The goal is to make “one more board” a choice, not a trap hidden inside the interface.",{"children":"We also keep the game visually calm and the core session legible. The goal is to make “one more board” a choice, not a trap hidden inside the interface."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"article-bullets","children":[["$","li","Stop after a clear without losing your place",{"children":"Stop after a clear without losing your place"}],["$","li","Use undo without spending a scarce resource",{"children":"Use undo without spending a scarce resource"}],["$","li","Keep pressure out of the core journey",{"children":"Keep pressure out of the core journey"}],["$","li","Let settings support the player’s context",{"children":"Let settings support the player’s context"}]]}],null,["$","p",null,{"className":"article-source-note","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Research trail"}],[["$","a","who-gaming-disorder",{"href":"#reference-who-gaming-disorder","aria-label":"Jump to source: World Health Organization (2020)","children":["[",3,"]"]}],["$","a","gaming-fit-2025",{"href":"#reference-gaming-fit-2025","aria-label":"Jump to source: Ballou et al. (2025)","children":["[",4,"]"]}]]]}]]}]
1e:["$","section","a-useful-question",{"id":"a-useful-question","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A useful question to ask yourself"}],[["$","p","Instead of asking whether a certain number of minutes is universally good or bad, ask: “Is this session fitting the rest of my life today?” If the answer is no—because you are tired, missing sleep, or feeling unable to stop—the kind move is to pause and change the conditions around play.",{"children":"Instead of asking whether a certain number of minutes is universally good or bad, ask: “Is this session fitting the rest of my life today?” If the answer is no—because you are tired, missing sleep, or feeling unable to stop—the kind move is to pause and change the conditions around play."}],["$","p","OutBrick is a game, not a clinician. If gaming is causing serious distress or interfering with daily life, talk with a qualified professional. A thoughtful game should leave room for that sentence.",{"children":"OutBrick is a game, not a clinician. If gaming is causing serious distress or interfering with daily life, talk with a qualified professional. A thoughtful game should leave room for that sentence."}]],null,null,["$","p",null,{"className":"article-source-note","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Research trail"}],[["$","a","who-gaming-disorder",{"href":"#reference-who-gaming-disorder","aria-label":"Jump to source: World Health Organization (2020)","children":["[",3,"]"]}],["$","a","time-wellbeing-2022",{"href":"#reference-time-wellbeing-2022","aria-label":"Jump to source: Vuorre et al. (2022)","children":["[",5,"]"]}]]]}]]}]
